==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Unbroken Bonds|Lickitung|152}} from the {{TCG|Unbroken Bonds}} expansion.
*This card's shiny rare print features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Lickitung}}.
*'''Tongue Slap''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Gym Heroes|Brock's Lickitung|41}} from the {{TCG|Gym Heroes}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

